# Palmetto Motors: Marty Quintero's dealership, by phone. The same lot as the pilot's dealer screen, for any seat (the boss's and
# the fixer's V key, the phone). (Fiction: nobody here is a real person.)
#
# Reads and acts through Talk.State: {{dl_*}} fields and buy_vehicle(), sell_car(), sell_truck(), toggle_fleet_auto().

~ start
if not dealer
	Radio: Nobody answers at the dealership. It is not open yet.
	=> END
{{dl_name}}: [[Palmetto Motors, Marty Quintero.|Marty. Cars, vans, and no questions about the vans.|Quintero. What are we driving today?]]
=> lot

~ lot
- Cars to drive.
	=> cars
- Trucks for the stash runs.
	=> trucks
- "What does the fleet look like?"
	{{dl_name}}: {{dl_fleet_line}}.
	=> lot
- Sell your newest car. ({{dl_last_car.get("name", "")}}: {{money_s(dl_last_car.get("resale", 0))}}) [if dl_cars > 0]
	do sell_car()
	if result != ""
		{{dl_name}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{dl_name}}: Sold. I will not ask where the scratches came from.
	=> lot
- Sell your newest truck. ({{dl_last_truck.get("name", "")}}: {{money_s(dl_last_truck.get("resale", 0))}}) [if dl_trucks > 0]
	do sell_truck()
	if result != ""
		{{dl_name}}: {{result}}
	else
		{{dl_name}}: Sold. Somebody will love it.
	=> lot
- Let my people run the fleet. [if not dl_auto]
	do toggle_fleet_auto()
	{{dl_name}}: Done: when there is money and a better truck, your people buy it.
	=> lot
- Take the fleet back. [if dl_auto]
	do toggle_fleet_auto()
	{{dl_name}}: Done: nothing is bought without your say-so.
	=> lot
- That's all.
	{{dl_name}}: [[Drive safe.|Mind the roadblocks.|Come back when the van gets too warm.]]
	=> END

~ cars
{{dl_name}}: What the pilot drives. Delivered to the aircraft, so you have to be on the ground.
- Sunrise Hatch. ({{money_s(dl_price("hatch"))}}) Cheap and cheerful. [if dl_can("hatch")]
	do buy_vehicle("hatch")
	=> bought
- Harbor Coupe. ({{money_s(dl_price("coupe"))}}) The starter car's twin. [if dl_can("coupe")]
	do buy_vehicle("coupe")
	=> bought
- Valley SUV. ({{money_s(dl_price("suv"))}}) For the cane roads. [if dl_can("suv")]
	do buy_vehicle("suv")
	=> bought
- Marlin GT. ({{money_s(dl_price("roadster"))}}) The fastest thing in the county. [if dl_can("roadster")]
	do buy_vehicle("roadster")
	=> bought
- Palmetto Limited. ({{money_s(dl_price("luxury"))}}) Leather, air conditioning, a bar. [if dl_can("luxury")]
	do buy_vehicle("luxury")
	=> bought
- Back.
	=> lot

~ trucks
{{dl_name}}: The fleet's best truck sets the speed, its best cover cuts the roadblock odds, its steel is the roadblock that does not stop it.
- Courier Van. ({{money_s(dl_price("van"))}}) 45 km/h, a little cover. [if dl_can("van")]
	do buy_vehicle("van")
	=> bought
- Steel Box Truck. ({{money_s(dl_price("box"))}}) 41 km/h, 25% steel. [if dl_can("box")]
	do buy_vehicle("box")
	=> bought
- Midnight Van. ({{money_s(dl_price("fast"))}}) 54 km/h, 25% cover. [if dl_can("fast")]
	do buy_vehicle("fast")
	=> bought
- Ambulance Conversion. ({{money_s(dl_price("ambulance"))}}) 50 km/h, 45% cover: nobody stops an ambulance. [if dl_can("ambulance")]
	do buy_vehicle("ambulance")
	=> bought
- Armoured Truck. ({{money_s(dl_price("armoured"))}}) 34 km/h, 60% steel. [if dl_can("armoured")]
	do buy_vehicle("armoured")
	=> bought
- Back.
	=> lot

~ bought
if result != ""
	{{dl_name}}: {{result}}
else
	{{dl_name}}: Pleasure. The keys are yours.
=> lot
